# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# cfg-talespire-symbiote environment variables
#
# This symbiote is a static bundle (index.html + scripts/ + icons/) served
# directly to TaleSpire — no build step, no runtime env vars required.
#
# The Core URL the iframe loads is hard-coded in scripts/main.js as CORE_URL.
# Edit that constant to point at your deployment, or override at runtime via
# TaleSpire's per-campaign localStorage (TS.localStorage.campaign) — see the
# init() function in scripts/main.js.
#
# This file exists so the contract is documented: there is nothing to set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
